# An end-of-line comment after a header (case 09): safe fix.
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper] # main
threads=4
-- fixed.cnf --
# main
[mydumper]
threads=4
-- diagnostics --
1:1-1:18 error MDL106[invalid-group-line] unexpected text after the group header: `# main`; GLib only allows spaces after `]` (GLib: Key file contains line “[mydumper] # main” which is not a key-value pair, group, or comment)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
  fix (safe): Move the comment to its own line above the header
